{"content":[{"c":["JACHIN*"],"sourceClass":"h1","t":"p"},{"c":["1. Son of Simeon and leader of the Jachinites, who immigrated to Egypt with his grandfather Jacob (",{"href":"?bref=Gen.46.10","r":"Gen.46.10","rawR":"Gen.46.10","sourceRefs":[{"raw":"Gen.46.10","value":"Gen.46.10"}],"t":"ref","v":"Gn 46:10"},"; ",{"href":"?bref=Exod.6.15","r":"Exod.6.15","rawR":"Exod.6.15","sourceRefs":[{"raw":"Exod.6.15","value":"Exod.6.15"}],"t":"ref","v":"Ex 6:15"},"; ",{"href":"?bref=Num.26.12","r":"Num.26.12","rawR":"Num.26.12","sourceRefs":[{"raw":"Num.26.12","value":"Num.26.12"}],"t":"ref","v":"Nm 26:12"},"). He is called Jarib in ",{"href":"?bref=1Chr.4.24","r":"1Chr.4.24","rawR":"1Chr.4.24","sourceRefs":[{"raw":"1Chr.4.24","value":"1Chr.4.24"}],"t":"ref","v":"1 Chronicles 4:24"},"."],"sourceClass":"list","t":"p"},{"c":["2. Priest who lived in Jerusalem after the exile (",{"href":"?bref=1Chr.9.10","r":"1Chr.9.10","rawR":"1Chr.9.10","sourceRefs":[{"raw":"1Chr.9.10","value":"1Chr.9.10"}],"t":"ref","v":"1 Chr 9:10"},"; ",{"href":"?bref=Neh.11.10","r":"Neh.11.10","rawR":"Neh.11.10","sourceRefs":[{"raw":"Neh.11.10","value":"Neh.11.10"}],"t":"ref","v":"Neh 11:10"},"). The name Jachin may possibly designate a family of priests of which Jachin was the head."],"sourceClass":"list","t":"p"},{"c":["3. Descendant of Aaron and head of the 21st course of priests assigned to temple duty in David’s reign (",{"href":"?bref=1Chr.24.17","r":"1Chr.24.17","rawR":"1Chr.24.17","sourceRefs":[{"raw":"1Chr.24.17","value":"1Chr.24.17"}],"t":"ref","v":"1 Chr 24:17"},")."],"sourceClass":"list","t":"p"}],"format":"bsb-study-dictionary-v2","id":"Jachin","provenance":{"archiveSha256":"10758ea00dbea7540f9337e43e59c8e4000295c1261e3426bab6f31c31dcff5b","release":"1.6","sourceCitationReferences":[{"anchorText":"Gn 46:10","canonicalization":"deferred_to_dictionary_mapping_workstream","hrefExact":"?bref=Gen.46.10","rawQueryValue":"Gen.46.10","sourceRefExact":"Gen.46.10"},{"anchorText":"Ex 6:15","canonicalization":"